BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-30T08:07:19&endDate=2026-08-30T12:58:29">Disruption map.</a>\n\nMetropolitan Line: No service between Baker Street and Aldgate and SEVERE DELAYS on the rest of the line while emergency services respond to a large fire near the railway at Neasden. Tickets will be accepted on London Buses\, Lioness line\, London Northwestern and Thameslink services. Service is not expected to resume fully until early afternoon. 
